5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm the Seer. I'll check one of you tonight. Stay calm and listen carefully.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Servas,,"A bold start, Takumi. Wisdom lies in patience. Let us observe the night's whispers before we judge.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Servas"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Servas**: A bold start, Takumi. Wisdom lies in patience. Let us observe the night's whispers before we judge.""}]}"
7,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree with Servas. Let's stay calm and listen to everyone's thoughts before making any decisions.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I observe. Silence is often louder than words. Let us see who trembles when the night falls.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Ryuji,,I remain silent. Let the night reveal its secrets.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Midori, your calmness is suspicious. Why are you so eager to keep us quiet?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Takumi, do not let suspicion cloud your judgment. Midori seeks harmony, not silence. Let us trust the process.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Servas"",""self"":true,""raw"":""**Servas**: Takumi, do not let suspicion cloud your judgment. Midori seeks harmony, not silence. Let us trust the process.""}]}"
12,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I’m just trying to keep the peace, Takumi. Please don’t jump to conclusions without any real evidence yet.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"Midori’s defense is reasonable. Takumi, your aggression is premature. We need facts, not accusations.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree with Toshio. Accusations without evidence are dangerous. Let us wait for the Seer’s results.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I’m not accusing, I’m testing. @Ryuji, your silence is just as suspicious. Why hide?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
