17,0,3,talk,Midori,,"Takumi, please lower your voice. We are all on the same side, remember? Let’s not create unnecessary tension before we even start.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: Takumi, please lower your voice. We are all on the same side, remember? Let’s not create unnecessary tension before we even start.""}]}"
18,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"Your aggression is a liability, Takumi. We need unity, not chaos. Let the night speak.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Toshio"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Toshio: Your aggression is a liability, Takumi. We need unity, not chaos. Let the night speak.""}]}"
19,0,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am not hiding. I am analyzing. Your accusations are baseless and counterproductive. Let us wait for the Seer’s results.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
